#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:36
msgid "2. Color Palette & Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:38
msgid "Background Surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:39
msgid ""
"**Marketing Black** (`#010102` / `#08090a`): The deepest background — the"
" canvas for hero sections and marketing pages. Near-pure black with an "
"imperceptible blue-cool undertone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:40
msgid ""
"**Panel Dark** (`#0f1011`): Sidebar and panel backgrounds. One step up "
"from the marketing black."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:41
msgid ""
"**Level 3 Surface** (`#191a1b`): Elevated surface areas, card "
"backgrounds, dropdowns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:42
msgid ""
"**Secondary Surface** (`#28282c`): The lightest dark surface — used for "
"hover states and slightly elevated components."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:44
msgid "Text & Content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:45
msgid ""
"**Primary Text** (`#f7f8f8`): Near-white with a barely-warm cast. The "
"default text color — not pure white, preventing eye strain on dark "
"backgrounds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:46
msgid ""
"**Secondary Text** (`#d0d6e0`): Cool silver-gray for body text, "
"descriptions, and secondary content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:47
msgid ""
"**Tertiary Text** (`#8a8f98`): Muted gray for placeholders, metadata, and"
" de-emphasized content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:48
msgid ""
"**Quaternary Text** (`#62666d`): The most subdued text — timestamps, "
"disabled states, subtle labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:50
msgid "Brand & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:51
msgid ""
"**Brand Indigo** (`#5e6ad2`): Primary brand color — used for CTA button "
"backgrounds, brand marks, and key interactive surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:52
msgid ""
"**Accent Violet** (`#7170ff`): Brighter variant for interactive elements "
"— links, active states, selected items."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:53
msgid ""
"**Accent Hover** (`#828fff`): Lighter, more saturated variant for hover "
"states on accent elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:54
msgid ""
"**Security Lavender** (`#7a7fad`): Muted indigo used specifically for "
"security-related UI elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:56
msgid "Status Colors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:57
msgid ""
"**Green** (`#27a644`): Primary success/active status. Used for \"in "
"progress\" indicators."
