msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md
msgid "Keyboard focus on interactive elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:289
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: On dark surfaces, traditional shadows (dark on "
"dark) are nearly invisible. Linear solves this by using semi-transparent "
"white borders as the primary depth indicator. Elevation isn't "
"communicated through shadow darkness but through background luminance "
"steps — each level slightly increases the white opacity of the surface "
"background (`0.02` → `0.04` → `0.05`), creating a subtle stacking effect."
" The inset shadow technique (`rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 0px 0px 12px 0px inset`) "
"creates a unique \"sunken\" effect for recessed panels, adding "
"dimensional depth that traditional dark themes lack."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:291
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:293
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:294
msgid ""
"Use Inter Variable with `\"cv01\", \"ss03\"` on ALL text — these features"
" are fundamental to Linear's typeface identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:295
msgid ""
"Use weight 510 as your default emphasis weight — it's Linear's signature "
"between-weight"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:296
msgid ""
"Apply aggressive negative letter-spacing at display sizes (-1.584px at "
"72px, -1.056px at 48px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:297
msgid ""
"Build on near-black backgrounds: `#08090a` for marketing, `#0f1011` for "
"panels, `#191a1b` for elevated surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:298
msgid ""
"Use semi-transparent white borders (`rgba(255,255,255,0.05)` to "
"`rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`) instead of solid dark borders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:299
msgid ""
"Keep button backgrounds nearly transparent: `rgba(255,255,255,0.02)` to "
"`rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:300
msgid ""
"Reserve brand indigo (`#5e6ad2` / `#7170ff`) for primary CTAs and "
"interactive accents only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:301
msgid ""
"Use `#f7f8f8` for primary text — not pure `#ffffff`, which would be too "
"harsh"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:302
msgid ""
"Apply the luminance stacking model: deeper = darker bg, elevated = "
"slightly lighter bg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:304
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:305
msgid ""
"Don't use pure white (`#ffffff`) as primary text — `#f7f8f8` prevents eye"
" strain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:306
msgid ""
"Don't use solid colored backgrounds for buttons — transparency is the "
"system (rgba white at 0.02–0.05)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:307
msgid ""
"Don't apply the brand indigo decoratively — it's reserved for "
"interactive/CTA elements only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:308
msgid ""
"Don't use positive letter-spacing on display text — Inter at large sizes "
"always runs negative"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:309
msgid ""
"Don't use visible/opaque borders on dark backgrounds — borders should be "
"whisper-thin semi-transparent white"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:310
msgid ""
"Don't skip the OpenType features (`\"cv01\", \"ss03\"`) — without them, "
"it's generic Inter, not Linear's Inter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:311
msgid ""
"Don't use weight 700 (bold) — Linear's maximum weight is 590, with 510 as"
" the workhorse"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:312
msgid ""
"Don't introduce warm colors into the UI chrome — the palette is cool gray"
" with blue-violet accent only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_linear.app.md:313
msgid ""
"Don't use drop shadows for elevation on dark surfaces — use background "
"luminance stepping instead"
msgstr ""

